Server init.
>> a := Blob novo: 4.
a bytes: ( Listar novo ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob novo: 4.
b bytes: ( Listar novo ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a novo.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Saída escrever: ( a ^ c ), stop. } pegar: { :e Saída escrever: e, stop. }, iniciar.
a livre.
b livre.
